<header><p class="st-kicker">city state · Italy</p><h1 class="st-title">Commune of Lodi</h1><p class="st-meta">1158 CE – 1335 CE (approx.) · capital Lodi</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">A Lombard city-republic refounded on a new site by Frederick Barbarossa in 1158 after Milan had destroyed the old town.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p><a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/duchy-of-milan">Milan</a> destroyed the old town of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lodi-dynasty">Lodi</a> in 1111 and again in 1158. That year <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/frederick-barbarossa">Emperor Frederick Barbarossa</a>, whom the Lodigiani had appealed to, refounded the city on a new site on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/adda">Adda</a>, a few miles from the old one, now <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lodi-vecchio">Lodi Vecchio</a>. The new commune grew under imperial protection.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>The commune was governed by consuls and later a podestà. Although founded as an imperial ally, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lodi-dynasty">Lodi</a> joined the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/lombard-league">Lombard League</a> in 1167. The cathedral was begun in the year of its refoundation. The town lived from farming and river trade, but was always overshadowed by <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/duchy-of-milan">Milan</a>. In the 13th and 14th centuries the Fissiraga and Vistarini families competed for control.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>In 1335 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lodi-dynasty">Lodi</a> submitted to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/azzone-visconti">Azzone Visconti</a> and became part of the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/lordship-of-milan">Lordship of Milan</a>. The Peace of Lodi of 1454 between <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/duchy-of-milan">Milan</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/venice">Venice</a> was later signed there.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="city state, 1158 CE – 1335 CE (approx.)"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 82 V42 H32 V34 H40 V42 H46 V34 H54 V42 H60 V34 H68 V42 H76 V82 Z"/><path d="M44 82 V66 Q50 58 56 66 V82"/><path d="M34 